  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger. Cook until onion is translucent.",
    "Add fish, curry paste, fish sauce, and lime juice. Cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in fish stock and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 8-10 minutes or until fish is cooked through.",
    "Stir in coconut milk and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Ladle into bowls and serve hot."
